@* WizardShell — centered layout wrapper for /wizard content.
 *
 * Uses MainLayout as the outer chrome (via @layout). Adds a centered
 * MudContainer with the PinballWizard visual identity tokens so all
 * /wizard pages share consistent horizontal margins and max-width.
 *
 * Wave 2 PR-D-stream mounts WizardAnswerStream inside this shell.
 * The shell itself is an @page "/"  omitted — it is a layout partial,
 * not a routable page. Pages that want this layout declare
 * @layout WizardShell (if they also want a nested centered container).
 * Alternatively, pages can use @Body directly from MainLayout and
 * render their own MudContainer — WizardShell is a convenience
 * partial for /wizard/* pages that all share the same container width.
 *
 * Category: chrome wrapper — wraps MudBlazor MudContainer. Not a custom
 * delight surface in the ADR-0026 § 6 sense.
 *
 * ADR-0026  § 1, § 6 — /wizard anonymous, auto-render mode, chrome
 * ADR-0008  — MudBlazor strict
 *@

@inherits LayoutComponentBase
@layout MainLayout

<MudContainer MaxWidth="MaxWidth.Large" Class="wizard-shell py-6">
    @Body
</MudContainer>
